C0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5VyPgb5Fkl48IYjItFJY_bNJkm4IgtdZduQvzpN_Dig&oe=6AF46D84"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Impossible", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dare to take the journey.\n\nImpossible is a minimalist VR challenge built around timing, precision and the irresistible urge to try just one more time.\n\nHigh above the world, a seemingly simple path stands between you and the finish. Watch carefully, learn the rhythm and choose your next move. The further you progress, the greater the pressure becomes and a single mistake can bring your run to an abrupt end.\n\nThere are no complicated rules to learn. The challenge is simple: keep moving forward.\n\nDesigned around a clean, striking visual style and an easy-to-understand gameplay loop, Impossible is about mastering each attempt, learning from every failure and pushing further than you did before.\n\nCan you stay calm, trust your timing and reach the end?\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Precision-based VR gameplay\n\u2022 Simple mechanics with a demanding challenge\n\u2022 Rhythm and timing-driven obstacles\n\u2022 Fast retries that encourage one more attempt\n\u2022 Minimalist environments with a distinctive visual style\n\u2022 A challenge designed to be learned, mastered and conquered\n\nThe path is waiting.\n\nDare to take the journey.", "short_description": "A minimalist VR precision challenge where every step matters. Read the rhythm, trust your timing and make your way across a surreal path suspended high above the world. One mistake can send you all the way back. How far can you go?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.titlesunknownstudios.com/privacy-policy/impossible", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Title Unknown Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.titlesunknownstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTAB